name: sim.setScriptText
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.setScriptText(int scriptHandle,string scriptText)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setScriptText(int scriptHandle,string scriptText)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. scriptHandle: handle of a script
2. scriptText: pointer to a script buffer (0-terminated buffer). This function will copy the buffer content, so that it can immediately be released after this call
